{
  "thag2.10:0.1": "Verses of the Senior Monks 2.10 ",
  "thag2.10:0.2": "The Book of the Twos ",
  "thag2.10:0.3": "Chapter One ",
  "thag2.10:0.4": "Vasabha ",
  "thag2.10:1.1": "First one kills oneself, ",
  "thag2.10:1.2": "then one kills others. ",
  "thag2.10:1.3": "One kills oneself, really dead, ",
  "thag2.10:1.4": "like one who kills birds using a dead bird as a decoy. ",
  "thag2.10:2.1": "A brahmin’s color is not on the outside; ",
  "thag2.10:2.2": "a brahmin is colored on the inside. ",
  "thag2.10:2.3": "Whoever harbors bad deeds ",
  "thag2.10:2.4": "is truly a dark one, Sujampati. ",
